      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ashdown%2C_Arkansas",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1966, the Corps of Engineers dammed the Little and Saline Rivers, creating Millwood Lake for flood control and recreation.",
